# The server image needs only crates/sync-api and server/ (server/Dockerfile).
*
!crates/sync-api/**
!server/**
!Cargo.toml
server/target
crates/sync-api/target
# A deployment's own files never go into an image or its build cache (the
# environment, the server secret, backups, a decrypted restore dump): the
# server image needs nothing from server/deploy.
server/deploy
server/README.md
**/restore.sql
